Subject: mt7996: implement retail BESRA multi-client TXOP votes

Reconstruct traffic qualification, previous-interval RX length, default
16-client threshold and separate per-band UL vote with retry/reset
handling. Leave optional CW/WRR and TALOS-only SPL behavior untouched.
This is not a complete vendor scheduler port or a throughput fix.

